	text: [
		"§6Living Armor§r enters a §6symbiotic relationship§r with the wearer, slowly §6adapting§r to the wearers behaviours.",
		"",
		"For example when someone takes frequent §6fall damage§r, the armor will start to apply §6protection§r against fall damage. ",
		"",
		"If the wearer §6sprints§r a lot, the armor will provide additional §6speed§r. ",
		"",
		"There is a §6limit§r of how many upgrades the armor piece can hold.",
		"",
		"Only the §6chestpiece§r gains these benefits, and a §6full set§r must be worn for it to apply. "
	],
